  "problems": [],
  "document": "Commitment (song)\n\"Commitment\" is a song written by Tony Colton, Tony Marty and Bobby Wood, and recorded by American country music artist LeAnn Rimes. It was released in April 1998 as the lead single from her album \"Sittin' on Top of the World\". The song placed at number 4 on the US country charts, number 38 in the UK. It was later featured on Rimes' \"Greatest Hits\" and its international version, \"The Best of LeAnn Rimes\"."
